; FARO - exterior tileset (overworld): Varadero, Sendero del Cabo, the cape with the lighthouse, the glade.
; Used through res/metatiles.mt (16x16 metatiles; labels <METATILE>_<TL|TR|BL|BR> mark the first use of a tile).
; VRAM (GDD 7.2, LCDC.4=0): this set is loaded right after fonts (72) + UI (12) = BG index 84..255, contiguous:
;   tiles 0..43 -> $9540.. (BG-only half), tiles 44..167 -> $8800.. (shared half). metatiles.mt uses '@ base 84'.
; Budget 168 tiles (84 + 168 = 252: BG 252-255 hold the HUD sprite tiles, design/ui.md 1.4).
; Merged to fit: TREE_11 BR = BLANK, BERRY BL = BUSH_BL, BOAT_00 TR = BOAT_01_TL (do not re-add).
; Style: ground light (0-1), obstacles outlined in black, actors dark.
; Animated tiles (E16): WATER_TL/TR (water A/B) and FLOWERS_TL/TR swap with overworld_anim.tiles every 24 f.
; Tall grass (TALLGRASS): top half colour 0 so Leo's head shows; bottom half has no colour 0 (PRIO hides legs).
; 168 tiles. Generated from a script, then this file is the source of truth.

